{"3921010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "War Alert", "steam_appid": 3921010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focusing on tactical realism and immersive combat, this game rejects the classic RTS &quot;swarm&quot; tactic. It champions a more sophisticated strategy, where the skillful use of terrain, cover, suppressing fire, and resource dominance leads to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living battlefield, rendered in stunning detail by Unreal Engine, ensures no two conflicts are ever the same. Watch as structures crumble under fire, tracks churn through the mud, and ruins smolder in the aftermath—each one a silent testament to your command and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command infantry and vehicle units to navigate ruins, capture and advance positions along a dynamic frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/e08ae771eab471452cfb9d5d49969664.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/e08ae771eab471452cfb9d5d49969664.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/e08ae771eab471452cfb9d5d49969664.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dynamic battlefields of PVP, there is no predetermined plot—only the pure clash of wits and a fundamental belief in strategy. This is a fair arena where victory is decided by intellect alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/0c768d22b28bcfe73964145a43303d9d.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/0c768d22b28bcfe73964145a43303d9d.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/0c768d22b28bcfe73964145a43303d9d.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commanders fight as one, mastering the flow of battle through tactical coordination, resource management, and precise synergy. The Legion assembles—forged for victory, not for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/c771ed4765cc585f1d104914509afb11.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focusing on tactical realism and immersive combat, this game rejects the classic RTS &quot;swarm&quot; tactic. It champions a more sophisticated strategy, where the skillful use of terrain, cover, suppressing fire, and resource dominance leads to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/3512867c514c57812a2c6a2ece3bea18.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living battlefield, rendered in stunning detail by Unreal Engine, ensures no two conflicts are ever the same. Watch as structures crumble under fire, tracks churn through the mud, and ruins smolder in the aftermath—each one a silent testament to your command and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.webm?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/9aed7784eb8fd6edbe04b42127621a40.mp4?t=1786932857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command infantry and vehicle units to navigate ruins, capture and advance positions along a dynamic frontline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921010/extras/e08ae771eab471452cfb9d5d49969664.poster.avif?t=1786932857\" width=1170